  "limitations": [
    "Local acquire_lease advances epoch atomically but has no time expiry; not equivalent to workbook bounded leaseMs.",
    "Capability required scopes and holder/epoch enforced; approval_token only checked for presence in this layer, not independently verified here.",
    "Idempotency key indexed by capability; request hash includes actor/work/epoch/payload; successful replay returns prior result. Failed or executing key cannot be automatically retried.",
    "Default circuit opens after three failures for 30 seconds. No automatic retry scheduler or dependency DAG established by these modules.",
    "CrossSectorExecutor requires explicit handler bindings; unbound returns UNBOUND. Handler-returned observations and receipt hashes are actor evidence, not external different-model assessment.",
    "Twelve-sector registry is a declared capability map; adapter availability must be independently observed before offload.",
    "Original R6 test import collides with installed mcp package. With python -S it fails obsolete 17-capability assertion against current 25. Source left unchanged."
  ],
